The editor clients (Visual Studio Code, Zed, Neovim) and the tree-sitter
grammar live in their own repository:

    https://github.com/kairolang/kairo-lsp

    vscode/             the VS Code extension
    zed/                the Zed extension
    nvim/               the Neovim plugin
    tree-sitter-kairo/  the grammar Zed and Neovim highlight with

Each is a thin client of kals, the language server in Analyzer/ here, and
finds it on PATH.
